  "sample": {
   "x": -1520,
   "y": -280,
   "text": "Built on frappe-ui. One Sidebar on every desktop screen: the app menu at the top (brand and user, opening Apps, Desk, kiosk, help, theme, settings, log out, as in Frappe CRM and Helpdesk), then the company items, or the plant switcher and plant items inside a plant. Frappe Factory runs standalone as a monitoring app; Production runs, run detail and the Manufacturing half of the Dashboard need ERPNext linked (same site or another site). Koyo 1 at 08:46 on 22 Nov, 32 min after the lead trip, is the main story; every other plant (Plant B, Plant D, Oil mill, Rice mill, Poultry farm) is sample data. Every plant card opens its plant, and every board is linked: click through from the sidebar, app menu, settings and kiosk buttons. Desktop boards are 1440 \u00d7 900; kiosk boards are a 1180 \u00d7 820 tablet. Units: a sachet is 50 cl; a bag is 20 sachets (10 L); each Koyo filler is rated 2,000 sachets (100 bags) an hour.",
